# Regenerable build artifacts — rebuild from deck.yaml with the vector-slides
# build loop (see HOW-WE-WORK.md). The committed figure PNGs + deck.yaml are the
# source of truth; the compiled deck and QA renders are derived.
sessions/*/deck.pptx
sessions/*/qa/

# Office lock/temp files (created when a .pptx is open in PowerPoint)
~$*
*~

# Derived backtest cache (re-created by figures_*.py; the figure PNGs are committed)
assets/figures/**/_*.json

# PUBLIC REPO — do NOT commit PDFs or presentation binaries (copyrighted papers,
# internal decks). Keep them locally per SOURCES.md; they stay untracked here.
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.key
